.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
# A host build leaves tsconfig.tsbuildinfo next to its dist; with dist excluded, tsc (composite) would call the
# project up to date and emit nothing, and the next package fails with TS2307 (Pi, 2026-11-15).
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.claude
!.claude/skills/foundry-core-ui/reference
*.log
.env
